+# Recorded p95 latency baseline of GET /{short_code} (RedirectLatencyBudgetIT, AC-13).
+#
+# Recorded with the same in-process fixture the IT uses (Spring Boot on a random port, Testcontainers
+# PostgreSQL 17 + Redis 7, JDK HttpClient, warm JIT, cache-hit redirects) before click recording was
+# added to the redirect path. RedirectLatencyBudgetIT fails when the measured p95 exceeds this value
+# by more than `tolerance-percent`.
+#
+# Re-record on the reference machine with
+#   ./mvnw -q -Pit verify -Dit.test=RedirectLatencyBudgetIT -Dredirect.latency.record=true
+# which writes target/redirect-latency-baseline.properties; copy the file here after review.
+# Override without editing the file: -Dredirect.latency.baseline-p95-ms=<millis>.
+p95-ms=50
+tolerance-percent=5
+warmup-requests=200
+sample-requests=400
